  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: UI_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9202a1d308e98e942987d694bc562658, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1045303296
    m_Localized: Task
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1112412160
    m_Localized: Question {n} of {total}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615867129856
    m_Localized: Enter participant code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615938433024
    m_Localized: Delete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627328
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627329
    m_Localized: "Test mode \u2013 not analysed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627330
    m_Localized: Is the code {participant_id} correct?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627331
    m_Localized: Edit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627332
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627333
    m_Localized: Continue the course of {participant_id}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627334
    m_Localized: 'Interrupted in: {scene_name}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627335
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627336
    m_Localized: Start over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627337
    m_Localized: '{participant_id} already has a finished session.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627338
    m_Localized: Start anyway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627339
    m_Localized: The session could not be started. Please restart the app.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627340
    m_Localized: Please take off the headset and tell the course leader.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627341
    m_Localized: 'Code: {participant_id}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627342
    m_Localized: "1.\_Introduction"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627343
    m_Localized: "2.\_Basics"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627344
    m_Localized: "3.\_Order picking by EKZ 3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627345
    m_Localized: "4.\_Several positions"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627346
    m_Localized: "5.\_Full cartons and loose material"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627347
    m_Localized: End the session?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627348
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627349
    m_Localized: End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627350
    m_Localized: Pick the order shown in the warehouse management system (WMS).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627351
    m_Localized: 1. Read the WMS data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627352
    m_Localized: 'Read in the WMS: material number (<nobr>Mat.-Nr</nobr>), target
      quantity (Soll), VPE (<nobr>Verp.-Einh.</nobr>), EKZ (<nobr>Empf Kz</nobr>).
      Rest: this many pieces stay in the storage container after the order.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627353
    m_Localized: 2. Pick the cartons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627354
    m_Localized: Work out how many cartons you need. Put the cartons into the order
      container as the EKZ requires.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627355
    m_Localized: 3. Confirm the order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627356
    m_Localized: Check in the WMS that Ist equals Soll. Then press the red button
      (F6).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627357
    m_Localized: Correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627358
    m_Localized: "The order is correct.\nThe order container moves onto the middle
      lane and leaves.\nNow choose \u201C4.\_Several positions\u201D in the menu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627359
    m_Localized: Not correct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627360
    m_Localized: The order is not correct. Check the WMS data and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627361
    m_Localized: F6
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627362
    m_Localized: 'PACKAGE PLACED: {placed}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627363
    m_Localized: The order container is empty. Put the material of the order into
      the container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627364
    m_Localized: The container holds wrong material. Take it out. Check the material
      number in the WMS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627365
    m_Localized: "Not enough {name}. Calculate again: order quantity \xF7 VPE."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627366
    m_Localized: "Too much {name}. Calculate again: order quantity \xF7 VPE."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627367
    m_Localized: 'Not enough loose {name}. Calculate again: order quantity minus
      the pieces in the full cartons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627368
    m_Localized: 'Too much loose {name}. Calculate again: order quantity minus the
      pieces in the full cartons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627369
    m_Localized: There are more errors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627370
    m_Localized: Not correct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627371
    m_Localized: "All materials and quantities match the order.\nThe order container
      moves onto the middle lane and leaves.\nNext, choose \u201C{next_lesson}\u201D
      in the menu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627372
    m_Localized: 'The full cartons and the loose material match the order.

      The
      order container moves onto the middle lane and leaves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627373
    m_Localized: Get to know the label and the warehouse management system (WMS).
      Then answer the questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627374
    m_Localized: 1. Read the label
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627375
    m_Localized: Pick up each package. The explanation is to the left of the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627376
    m_Localized: 2. Get to know the WMS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627377
    m_Localized: Read the explanation to the right of the screen. Press "Weiter".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627378
    m_Localized: 3. Answer the questions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627379
    m_Localized: The questions are below the screen. Press A, B or C.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627381
    m_Localized: Read the label
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627382
    m_Localized: Pick up a package. Here you see what the label says.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627383
    m_Localized: "Mat.-Nr: {matnr} \u2013 the material number. The same number is
      in the WMS."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627384
    m_Localized: "VPE: {vpe} ST \u2013 this many pieces are in this package."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627385
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627386
    m_Localized: Start over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627387
    m_Localized: Step {n} of {total}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627388
    m_Localized: The WMS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627389
    m_Localized: On the screen you see an order in the warehouse management system
      (WMS). Press "Weiter".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627390
    m_Localized: Mat.-Nr and Bez.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627391
    m_Localized: Mat.-Nr is the material number, Bez. is the name of the material.
      Compare both with the label.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627392
    m_Localized: Verp.-Einh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627393
    m_Localized: This many pieces are in one carton. On the label it says VPE for
      this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627394
    m_Localized: Soll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627395
    m_Localized: You must pick this many pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627396
    m_Localized: Ist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627397
    m_Localized: When weighing, Ist shows how many pieces are already in the order
      container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627398
    m_Localized: Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627399
    m_Localized: This many pieces stay in the storage container after the order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627400
    m_Localized: Empf Kz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627401
    m_Localized: 'Empf Kz shows the EKZ. It tells you how to put the parts in. 003
      is EKZ 3: put the parts in one by one and in order.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627402
    m_Localized: 'Other value: Empf Kz 000'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627403
    m_Localized: 'Here it shows 003, that is EKZ 3. Other orders can show 000 here,
      that is EKZ 0: the parts may lie unordered or be poured in. All EKZ are on
      the board to the right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627404
    m_Localized: Not in the exercise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627405
    m_Localized: You don't need the marked areas in the exercise. The Anweisung field
      stays empty in the exercise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627407
    m_Localized: <color=#27AE60><b>Correct!</b></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627408
    m_Localized: Now answer the next question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627409
    m_Localized: "You answered all questions correctly. Now choose \u201C{lesson}\u201D
      in the menu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627410
    m_Localized: <color=#EB5757><b>Not correct</b></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627411
    m_Localized: 'Soll 100, VPE 25: how many cartons do you take?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627415
    m_Localized: Which material has Mat.-Nr 738190?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627417
    m_Localized: 'Empf Kz 003: how do you put the parts into the order container?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627418
    m_Localized: Put in one by one and in order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627419
    m_Localized: Pour in unordered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627420
    m_Localized: 'Empf Kz 000: how may you put the parts into the order container?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627421
    m_Localized: Only one by one and in order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627422
    m_Localized: Pouring in is allowed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627423
    m_Localized: 'Read in the LVS: material number (Mat.-Nr), target quantity (Soll),
      VPE (Verp.-Einh.), EKZ (Empf Kz). Rest: this many pieces stay in the storage
      container after the order.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627424
    m_Localized: Practise two simple hand movements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627425
    m_Localized: 1. Grab the box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627426
    m_Localized: Reach for the box with one hand and lift it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627427
    m_Localized: 2. Press the button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627428
    m_Localized: Press the red button with your fingertip. Later you confirm the
      order with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627429
    m_Localized: Welcome to <color=#0391DD>XPick!</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627430
    m_Localized: A VR training for order picking in the warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627431
    m_Localized: What you will learn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627432
    m_Localized: "By the end of the course you will be able to:\n\u2022 read an order
      in the warehouse management system (WMS)\n\u2022 compare the label with the
      WMS (Mat.-Nr, VPE)\n\u2022 work out full cartons and loose pieces\n\u2022 place
      cartons according to the EKZ\n\u2022 pick several positions one after another"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627433
    m_Localized: 'Duration: about 5 minutes per lesson'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627434
    m_Localized: Your tasks are on the cards on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627435
    m_Localized: Then choose the next lesson in the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627436
    m_Localized: Pick the order shown in the warehouse management system (WMS). Work
      on the two positions one after the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627437
    m_Localized: 'Read for the current position: material number (<nobr>Mat.-Nr</nobr>),
      target quantity (Soll), VPE (<nobr>Verp.-Einh.</nobr>) and EKZ (<nobr>Empf
      Kz</nobr>).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627438
    m_Localized: 2. Pick the material
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627439
    m_Localized: Work out how many packages you need. Put the packages into the order
      container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627440
    m_Localized: Check in the WMS that Ist equals Soll. Then press the red button
      (F6).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627441
    m_Localized: Pick the order shown in the warehouse management system (WMS). The
      order has two positions with loose material. Work on both one after the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627442
    m_Localized: 'Read in the WMS: material number (<nobr>Mat.-Nr</nobr>), target
      quantity (Soll), VPE (<nobr>Verp.-Einh.</nobr>) and EKZ (<nobr>Empf Kz</nobr>).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627443
    m_Localized: Work out how many full cartons and loose pieces you need. Put the
      cartons into the order container first, then the loose pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627444
    m_Localized: Count the full cartons and the loose pieces. Check in the WMS that
      Ist equals Soll. Then press the red button (F6).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627445
    m_Localized: Congratulations!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627446
    m_Localized: What you learned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627447
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Read an order in the WMS\n\u2022 Compare the label with
      the WMS (Mat.-Nr, VPE)\n\u2022 Work out full cartons and loose pieces\n\u2022
      Place cartons according to the EKZ\n\u2022 Pick several positions one after
      another\n\u2022 The red button stands in for confirming with your foot"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627448
    m_Localized: 'Position {position} is done.

      The storage container leaves;
      the next one comes from the left.

      Then read the data of position {next_position}
      in the WMS.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627449
    m_Localized: Not all cartons are placed in order. With Empf Kz 003, put the cartons
      in one by one and in order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627450
    m_Localized: The way of the containers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627451
    m_Localized: The storage container comes from the left. After each confirmation
      it leaves over the middle lane. The order container stays on the right until
      the order is done. Then it also leaves there. The whole process is on the board
      on the far right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627452
    m_Localized: How many full cartons do you take for this position?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627453
    m_Localized: How many loose pieces do you take in addition?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627454
    m_Localized: 1 carton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627455
    m_Localized: '{count} cartons'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627456
    m_Localized: 1 piece
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627457
    m_Localized: '{count} pieces'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627458
    m_Localized: <color=#EB5757><b>Not correct.</b></color> Divide Soll by VPE. Only
      full cartons count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627459
    m_Localized: "<color=#EB5757><b>Not correct.</b></color> Loose pieces = Soll
      minus (full cartons \xD7 VPE)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627460
    m_Localized: <color=#27AE60><b>Correct!</b></color> Now answer the second question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627461
    m_Localized: <color=#27AE60><b>Correct!</b></color> Now take the full cartons
      and the loose pieces from the storage container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627462
    m_Localized: Example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627463
    m_Localized: "Soll 64 ST, VPE 20 ST\n1. 64 : 20 = 3.2 \u2013 so 3 full cartons
      (60 ST)\n2. 64 - 60 = 4 loose pieces\nCheck: 60 + 4 = 64 ST"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627464
    m_Localized: 'Position {done} is done.

      The opened carton with the broken-case
      quantity stays in the module in the storage container.

      Read the details
      of position {next} in the WMS.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627465
    m_Localized: Put the full cartons into the order container first, then the loose
      pieces from the opened carton.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7615942627466
    m_Localized: 'Read in the WMS: material number (<nobr>Mat.-Nr</nobr>), target
      quantity (Soll), VPE (<nobr>Verp.-Einh.</nobr>) and EKZ (<nobr>Empf Kz</nobr>).
      Then answer the questions below the screen. The "Example" board directly below
      them helps with the calculation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15832974233600
    m_Localized: MENU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687593684992
    m_Localized: 2 cartons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182464
    m_Localized: 2 cartons are only 50 pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182465
    m_Localized: 4 cartons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182466
    m_Localized: 25 cartons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182467
    m_Localized: '25 is the VPE: the number of pieces in one carton. Divide Soll
      by VPE.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182468
    m_Localized: KABELVERBINDER A
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182469
    m_Localized: SCHRAUBE B
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182470
    m_Localized: RING D
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182471
    m_Localized: Compare the Mat.-Nr on the labels with 738190.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182472
    m_Localized: Compare the Mat.-Nr on the labels with 738190.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182473
    m_Localized: With 003 the parts must lie one by one and in order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33687669182474
    m_Localized: With 000 the parts may lie unordered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
